## How each gem color looks as a kit drill on the board, seen from a
## little way off: the mean color of a whole cell (drill, paper and
## shadow), measured on the 3D board by tools/calibrate_kit_colors.gd
## over several light positions, as meshes and as impostors.
## Generated: run that tool again after changing the gem shaders, the
## paper or the gem colors.

